# Instructor-only — answer keys + the solution-bearing homework builders live in the
# PRIVATE companion repo TCU-DCDA/WRIT20833_2026_keys, never in this student-facing repo.
*_ANSWER_KEY.ipynb
notebooks/homework/_build_hw*.py

# Generated AddRan Word export of the syllabus — a working draft edited in Word
# (pandoc'd from SYLLABUS_2026.md, which stays the source of truth). The glob matches
# both the [section] placeholder name and the renamed WRIT20833-<section>_… version.
WRIT20833-*_Summer2026_Rode.docx

# Throwaway local site previews (image paths rewritten to local files)
*.preview.html

# TCU Online (D2L) build products — the generators in d2l/ and WIRING_CHECKLIST.md are what's
# tracked; the packages are reproducible. Raw D2L exports carry the course's org-unit id and
# must never land in this public repo (the guard workflow checks for them).
d2l/WRIT20833_Fall2026_*/
d2l/WRIT20833_Fall2026_*.imscc
d2l/WRIT20833_Fall2026_*.zip
d2l/WRIT20833_Fall2026_*-homepage-widget.html
*.imscc
D2LExport_*/
d2l/__pycache__/
